{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>This is the demo version of Stand By Me: Otome Isekai RPG.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">As an RPG-visual novel hybrid, our game offers the best of both worlds \u2014 the rich storytelling and art of a visual novel, and the ability to interact with your environment and the people around you like in RPG games.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Take control of Ciel Rozenbleu and begin your adventure in the land of Desideria!\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Find your footing as assume you\u00a0your newfound, perplexing identity as a royal sorceress!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in a choice-based battle system which takes you through exciting combat scenes featuring full-color comic strips!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The demo version features about 60% of the common route, with 25K words and 4 hours of playtime</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/story.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/Story1.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/Story3.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/Story7.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/features.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your adventure in the Kingdom of Desideria and\u00a0<strong>explore 20 unique maps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/cielmirror.gif?t=1745131393\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in a<strong>\u00a0choice-based battle system</strong>\u00a0which takes you through exciting combat scenes featuring dynamic comic strips! The demo version includes <strong>3 combat sequences.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker.gif?t=1745131393\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy\u00a0<strong>full-colour character graphics and pixel art</strong>\u00a0for both main and side characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/ezgif-67f536f43fd38d.gif?t=1745131393\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Social Stats System:\u00a0</strong>Interact with the characters around you or do well in battles and you might just learn a thing or two - your progress from an ignorant knucklehead to a wise, powerful sorceress starts here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-11_010109.png?t=1745131393\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/characters.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/cieldraft.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/altairdraft.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/ruidraft.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/kieldraft.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/caiusdraft.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/dantedraft.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/about.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/FishAtticGames_2.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/Story6.png?t=1745131393\" />\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>\ud83e\udd0d Special Thanks:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Stand By Me PV: sense_aep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Game studio logo: IUM</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Una Map: SirenSongBoutique</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">PV Music: Yoshinori Tanaka</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665280?t=1745131393","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3665280?t=1745131393","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/3e805ff4a0b20552223e7920e1de4b0a81438a62/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1745131393","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.