665280/extras/features.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Begin your adventure in the Kingdom of Desideria and\u00a0<strong>explore 20 unique maps.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/cielmirror.gif?t=1745131393\" /></p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Engage in a<strong>\u00a0choice-based battle system</strong>\u00a0which takes you through exciting combat scenes featuring dynamic comic strips! The demo version includes <strong>3 combat sequences.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/ezgif.com-animated-gif-maker.gif?t=1745131393\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enjoy\u00a0<strong>full-colour character graphics and pixel art</strong>\u00a0for both main and side characters!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/ezgif-67f536f43fd38d.gif?t=1745131393\" /></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Social Stats System:\u00a0</strong>Interact with the characters around you or do well in battles and you might just learn a thing or two - your progress from an ignorant knucklehead to a wise, powerful sorceress starts here!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/Screenshot_2025-03-11_010109.png?t=1745131393\" /></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/characters.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3665280/extras/cieldraft.png?t=1745131393\" /></p><p class=\"bb_